      "runtime": "mono",
      "match": {},
      "notes": "Unity on Mono. The collector is Boehm (mono-2.0-bdwgc.dll), which never moves an object, so a resolved address stays good for the whole session and nothing needs re-deriving on a timer. Every value hangs off the single PlayerData instance, which exists only once a save is loaded."
    }
